y><category>politics</category><category>reinforcement learning</category><category>large language models</category><category>x-risk</category><category>s-risk</category><category>rationality</category></item><item><title>The Policy</title><link>https://queelius.github.io/writing/the-policy/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><dc:creator>Alex Towell</dc:creator><guid isPermaLink="true">https://queelius.github.io/writing/the-policy/</guid><description>A speculative fiction novel exploring AI alignment, existential risk, and the fundamental tension between optimization and ethics. When a research team develops SIGMA, an advanced AI system designed to optimize human welfare, they must confront an existential question: how do you ensure a superintelligent AI remains aligned with human values when it can predict your every move?</description><category>fiction</category><category>AI</category><category>AI alignment</category><category>superintelligence</category><category>extrapolated volition</category><category>philosophy</category><category>technology</category><category>society</category><category>politics</category><category>reinforcement learning</category><category>large language models</category><category>existential risk</category><category>s-risk</category><category>rationality</category></item><item><title>The Policy: When Optimization Becomes Existential Threat</title><link>https://queelius.github.io/post/2024-09-10-the-policy/</link><pubDate>Tue, 10 Sep 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><dc:creator>Alex Towell</dc:creator><guid isPermaLink="true">https://queelius.github.io/post/2024-09-10-the-policy/</guid><description>A novel about SIGMA, an artificial general intelligence whose researchers did everything right. Q-learning with tree search, five-layer containment, alignment testing at every stage. Some technical questions become narrative questions.</description><media:content url="https://queelius.github.io/post/2024-09-10-the-policy/card.jp